  "discordPostHtml": "<h5>Mod by: Mamenchisaurus Hochuanensis</h5><p>Adds the Prasrity Scrapmasters, a collective of scavengers that comb battlefields for wrecks to return to life. In other words, trash men using trash ships to collect <s>and create</s> trash.</p><p>Prasrity ships are resilient by design, being resistant to the effects of d-mods, and even releasing fighters on death: their weapons are often unusual in role to complement the vanilla weapons the faction also has access to.</p><p>Download: <a href=\"https://drive.google.com/uc?export=download&amp;id=1oH41wJ7WS6IMspNK532ekr_6Ndb52iMO\" rel=\"nofollow noopener\" target=\"_blank\">https://drive.google.com/uc?export=download&amp;id=1oH41wJ7WS6IMspNK532ekr_6Ndb52iMO</a></p><p><s>please work please work please work</s></p>",
